%% Every clause of the linked program is type-checked, an alias clause of the fifth step at the declaration of its entry point (TGLP modules.tex, Compilation).  Two entry points of different types: succ/2 over Integer and count/2 over String.
exported procedure succ(Integer?, Integer).
succ(N, M?) :- M := N? + 1.

exported procedure count(String?, Integer).
count(_, 1).
